  check_narm tm true false nrules iarm0_0_0RB1RB_1LC1RA_0RC1LD_1RA0LC ch_iarm0_0_0RB1RB_1LC1RA_0RC1LD_1RA0LC = true.
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.

